 "fixes_21oct": [
  {
   "commit": "3dd3c56",
   "what": "Arm setup gate: `hips_out_of_view` must hold for `HIPS_BLOCK_S` before the setup pause (other view gates keep `SETUP_BLOCK_S`); `setup_blocked` carries the visibility numbers"
  },
  {
   "commit": "3dd3c56",
   "what": "Hike cue rationing in the rule coach: at most `HIKE_CUES_PER_SET` captions per set, `HIKE_CUE_GAP_S` apart; detection, events, counts and stop rules unchanged"
  },
  {
   "commit": "ffc6341",
   "what": "Review labels are exercise-aware: the arm's `setup_blocked` reads \"camera view check paused the set\" (the arm has no sheet), counted by setup pauses, with the failing checks listed; hike reported as a flag"
  },
  {
   "commit": "2c311a0",
   "what": "Agent tool calls: guardrail refusals (stale, no_change, ...) are traced with `error_kind` + `refused` and counted apart from failures; the feedback answers are a typed event so the end-of-session note always has evidence to cite"
  },
  {
   "commit": "b1fe321",
   "what": "Socket-close instrumentation: every live socket writes a `socket_close` trace row (saved, close code, agent run in flight, seconds since the last agent run); `/api/review` counts sockets that closed before their session was saved"
  },
  {
   "commit": "a24aa1f",
   "what": "Therapist-only writes: schedule changes need `PRAXIS_THERAPIST_TOKEN` (the shared review site could change the prescription)"
  },
  {
   "commit": "44dc5d3",
   "what": "Agent pause ordering: after the fix line, `recalibrate` alone, wait, then `request_resume`; never stop after the fix line. Verified 15/15 scenarios and covered_marker 3/3 (`agent_recheck_2026-10-21_all.md`, `agent_recheck_2026-10-21_covered_marker_x3.md`)"
  }
 ]
